  "name": "Joyful",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/star-rising-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your positive energy can act as a boost for your allies, instilling them the confidence to succeed. You gain 3 positivity dice and you regain all spent positivity dice when you finish a short or long rest. If you see one of your allies critically fail, you regain 1 positivity die. Your positivity dice are d6s. You can roll only one positivity die per turn, and a positivity die is spent when you roll it.</p><p>You can use positivity dice in any of the following ways:</p><ul><li>When you see a friendly creature within 30 ft of you getting hit by an attack (can include yourself), you can use your reaction to roll your positivity die to add the number rolled to the creature’s AC for that attack, potentially causing it to miss.</li><li>As a bonus action, you can attempt to cheer on a friendly creature (can include yourself) within 30 ft of yourself, rolling the positivity die and adding it to their next skill check or saving throw. A creature can only benefit from one positivity die at a time.</li><li>When you roll initiative, you can spend one positivity die and add the roll to your check.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
